    "https://mcmurry.bamboohr.com/careers/93": {
      "title": "BambooHR",
      "description": "BambooHR Privacy Policy Job Openings Work Study - Fall '26 - CORE Program Office Assistant S3C - Abilene, Texas Position Description: The CORE Office Assistant serves as the first point of contact for students, faculty, staff, and visitors entering the Success Coaching Office. This position provides administrative support, assists with daily office operations, helps maintain a welcoming environment, and supports student engagement through social media and promotional efforts. The ideal candidate is friendly, organized, dependable, and passionate about helping fellow students succeed. Essential Duties and Responsibilities: Greet students, faculty, staff, and visitors in a professional and welcoming manner, assisting students with check-in procedures for coaching appointments and events. Answer basic questions about campus services and direct students to appropriate resources. Assist with preparation, planning, and promoting events and assisting CORE staff during events and special projects as assigned. Develop graphics, photos, videos, and student-focused posts that promote student success resources, and assist in creating content for the office’s social media platforms. This position requires a commitment of 10 hours per week, including designated office hours.  The ideal candidate is comfortable working independently as well as collaborating with campus partners and other students and will foster belonging and serve others through their work. EEO Statement McMurry University is committed to an educational and working environment that provides equal opportunity to all members of the university community and prohibits unlawful discrimination on the basis of race, color, gender, national origin, age, genetic information, disability or veteran status, in employment or the provision of services, in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws. Discrimination on the basis of sexual orientation is also prohibited pursuant to University policy. Apply for This Job Link to This Job Location Abilene, Texas Department S3C Employment Type Part-Time Minimum Experience Entry-level Privacy Policy • Terms of Service • © BambooHR All rights reserved."
